{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-smartcampus01",
    "name": "Smart Campus — Backend (P3)",
    "description": "Collection de test de l'API Smart Campus.\n\nUtilisation :\n1. Lancer le serveur : `python manage.py runserver`.\n2. Dans le dossier *Auth*, exécuter le **Login** correspondant au rôle voulu (admin / caissier / contrôleur / étudiant). Le token est sauvegardé automatiquement dans la variable {{access_token}} et réutilisé par toutes les requêtes.\n3. Tester les endpoints.\n\nRôles requis (rappel) :\n- payer scolarité = caissier ; statut = contrôleur/admin ; débit = caissier/admin ;\n- bloquer carte / dashboard / exonérer = admin ; solde & historique = l'étudiant concerné ou admin.\n\nLes endpoints `/api/transaction/debit/` et `/api/iot/scan/` exigent une enveloppe SIGNÉE par la carte : générer le corps avec `python manage.py simuler_scan --uid SC-2025-00001 --terminal RESTO-01` puis coller le JSON (valable 30 s).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "uid", "value": "SC-2025-00001" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paiement_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const d = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', d.access);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', d.refresh);",
                  "pm.test('login ok', () => pm.response.code === 200);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login", ""]
            }
          }
        },
